@startuml
title 3.8.4 Counter-propose an appointment
caption UC-129 | Planned | Proposed design
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor white
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
show footbox
<style>
lifeLine {
    LineStyle 0
}
</style>
skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ActorBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    GroupBackgroundColor white
    GroupHeaderBackgroundColor white
}

' Source: docs/requirements/uc.md
' Main entity migration: apps/api-node/src/migrations/002_lost_found_schema.sql
' One-table abstraction: related repository reads/writes stay inside the service.
actor "Claimant / Finder" as Actor
participant "Proposed Appointment Negotiation" as Page
participant "Proposed Appointments API" as API
participant "Appointment Service" as Service
participant "return_appointments" as Table <<entity>>

Actor -> Page: 1: Open Counter-propose an appointment
activate Page
Page -> API: 2: Submit counter-proposal (proposed interface)
activate API
API -> API: 3: Validate access session, role and input
alt Valid request
API -> Service: 4: Counter-propose an appointment
activate Service
Service -> Table: 5: Proposed: lock current pending proposal and version
activate Table
Table --> Service: 6: Current participant proposal
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 7: Require counterpart; validate replacement point/time
Service -> Table: 8: Proposed: preserve old attempt; record counter-proposal
activate Table
Table --> Service: 9: New pending negotiation version
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 10: Notify counterpart; require mutual acceptance
Service --> API: 11: Counter-proposal awaiting consent
API --> Page: 12: HTTP 200: Counter-proposal awaiting consent
Page --> Actor: 13: Show authorized result
deactivate Service
else Invalid input, missing session or insufficient role
API --> Page: 4.1: Proposed rejection: invalid input / authorization
Page --> Actor: 4.2: Show appropriate error; retain form/draft
end
deactivate API
deactivate Page

legend left
Scope: Planned: no counter-proposal endpoint/workflow. Reject-and-create is not negotiated
rescheduling; new schema/contract may be required.
endlegend
@enduml
